    <!-- About -->
    <string name="i_about_title">About &amp; food data</string>
    <string name="i_about_app">Unavu 0.3</string>
    <string name="i_about_app_text">Personal calorie &amp; nutrient tracker for Tamil Nadu food. Everything stays on this phone.</string>
    <string name="i_numbers_title">Where the numbers come from</string>
    <string name="i_numbers_text">• Ingredients: Indian Food Composition Tables 2017 (ICMR-NIN), %1$d items.\n• Dishes (%2$d): calculated from typical home recipes: raw ingredient weights ÷ cooked weight. Your choices (vegetables, dal, sugar, milk, oil level) change the numbers.\n• A few everyday items not in IFCT (salt, sugar, toned milk, curd, bread, Boost/Horlicks, sauces) use USDA or label values.\n• Fast-food items are home-recipe estimates, not official chain values.\n• Targets: Mifflin-St Jeor for calories; ICMR-NIN 2020 RDA for nutrients.</string>
    <string name="i_ifct_credit">IFCT 2017 data via @ifct2017/compositions (MIT)</string>

